+# Handoff: one arithmetic endpoint estimate is now proved
+
+## Exact source state
+
+Read main `b32ca2128e0deb0eec6eafb860776a5d6a28dcbb`, endpoint PR #23 at
+`c720f40530eed2f5969dbabe94dfd3fddc0f507f`, and confluent-transfer PR #24 at
